        {
            "key": "field_68020e3ccabce",
            "label": "Description",
            "name": "worldwide_description",
            "type": "wysiwyg",
            "instructions": "",
            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "<p>The creative industry is more competitive than ever. With more 3D artists, visualization studios and design professionals entering the market every day, simply being \"talented\" or \"experienced\" is no longer enough. To stand out, attract high-quality clients and grow sustainably, you need more than great work — <strong>you need a clear strategy<\/strong>:<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Clients are more selective<\/strong>. They’re no longer just looking for beautiful visuals — they want partners who understand their business goals, communicate clearly, and deliver reliably.<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Strong visuals alone aren’t enough<\/strong>. If your freelance practice or studio doesn’t reflect professionalism and strategic thinking, you risk being overlooked — even if your work is top-quality.<\/li>\r\n\r\n<p>This guide was created to help you <strong>take control of your growth<\/strong>. Instead of relying on word-of-mouth alone or waiting for clients to “just find you,” you’ll have the tools to attract the right people, retain them and turn your creative skills into a scalable business.<\/p>",
            "tabs": "all",
            "toolbar": "full",
            "media_upload": 1,
            "delay": 0
        },
